      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PREDICTING (3) has been out of the placings in two runs since a break, the latest when sixth over 1200m at this track after he was in the firing line on the bend. Has further improvement to come and is worth following up. CITY OF SIN (2) turned in a decent effort last start when he made late ground to finish third over 1100m at this track. Finds a suitable race and can figure in the finish. ONE LAST PROMISE (4) was quickly into stride at this course and distance last time and was handy on the corner but couldn't go on in the straight and finished sixth, beaten 4.5 lengths. Bold showing expected. BUADES (6) doesn't boast the best winning strike rate but ran a strong race last time out, finishing fourth and beaten only 2.25 lengths over 1100m at this track. Suitably placed so anticipating another bold showing. BLACK COAL (1) won't be far away.",
